# ST1a-on: ST1a-off with slop's torch flicker (`r_torchflicker 1`).
#
# Assembly (ST1a): ST1a-on wipes in from the right over ST1a-off between file seconds 1.4
# and 5.4 (smoothstep), behind a 4-pixel bronze line; the 1440x1080 picture sits at x 240
# of a black 1920x1080 frame. Labels "ID'S: BAKED, STILL" (top left) and "SLOP:
# FLICKERING" (bottom right until the line passes it, then top right), on 82% dark bands.
# The sound is ST1a-on's.

demo demo1 from 32.5

duration 7.3
fps 60
size 1440x1080

preset classic
mode 960x600
display 4:3
hud off
cvar gamma 0.8
cvar r_torchflicker 1

sound on
events on
